  "description": "The Vaporesso Xros Mini Retro Pod Kit combines classic styling with incredibly straightforward performance to deliver a highly dependable everyday device. Powered by a robust 1000mAh built-in battery, this pocket-friendly kit provides reliable all-day longevity without the bulk of a larger setup. It is the perfect choice for vapers who want a compact, fuss-free device that still delivers exceptional consistency. Designed for pure intuition, the Xros Mini Retro operates via seamless inhale activation, completely removing the need for buttons, menus, or complicated settings. You simply draw on the mouthpiece to vape. When a recharge is eventually required, the convenient USB-C port ensures your downtime is kept to an absolute minimum. A clear LED indicator allows you to monitor your battery life at a quick glance, keeping you firmly in control of your daily sessions. The kit includes the upgraded 2ml Corex 3.0 mesh pod, which features an innovative hive mesh structure to ensure rapid heating and highly accurate flavour from your chosen e-liquids. Maintaining your setup is effortless thanks to the snap-top refill design, allowing you to replenish your vape juice cleanly without removing the cartridge from the battery. Supported by Vaporesso's SSS 2.0 leak-resistant technology to prevent spills, and cross-compatible with the wider Xros pod family (excluding the 0.4ohm variant), this stylish kit offers outstanding versatility for anyone seeking a straightforward mouth-to-lung experience. Simple, stylish and long-lasting, the XROS Mini is as easy to use as it is satisfying and is ideal for use with classic , 50/50 and nic salt e-liquids. Please Note: This kit dose not come with a USB-C charging cable.",
